Plane-wave Al metal case using `ks_solver=ppcg`.

The case checks the final energy, forces, stress, symmetry and irreducible
k-point count with the standard integration-test reference. The real-space
SCF density criterion and the 200-step inner budget keep the stress check
converged while leaving the PPCG stopping rule unchanged. The case is a
correctness regression; its recorded wall time is not a performance claim.
